&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and own the technical roadmap for autonomous constellation operations

